# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Caitlin A. McCandler et al. (2024). Gold–Thiolate Nanocluster Dynamics and Intercluster Reactions Enabled by a Machine Learned Interatomic Potential.
#   ACS Nano. doi:10.1021/acsnano.4c03094
#
# Version read: submittedVersion (sha256 4d5570dfa010650e...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 160 (Application/model instance). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
#
# Encoding scope: the Au-S-C-H ACE potential for methylthiolate-protected
# gold nanoclusters: GPAW reference data, the training set assembled from
# earlier AIMD and Monte Carlo data plus active learning, settings, and
# the energy and force RMSEs stated in the text. Cluster dynamics and
# intercluster reactions are not encoded. Read from the submitted version.

