###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The sentence giving the force RMSEs pairs 'testing and training' with 121.1 and 87.83 meV/A and then '14% and 22%'; the assignment follows the sentence order and should be checked against the PDF.
# - The paper says kappa = 0.9 was set 'to prioritize learning the forces'; the value is encoded as given. Per-pair n_max and l_max of the final potential (Table 2) are not encoded.
# - Relaxed-structure energies of known clusters (Table 1), vibrational spectra, chiral transition barriers and the coalescence simulations are not encoded. Read from the submitted version, not the ACS Nano version of record.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).

